{"title":"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A merchant offers a large group of items at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/e/32e5939a7bdd847ec86582225cd653c240b4abce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> off. Later, the merchant takes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> off these sale prices. The total discount is\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/a/35ae60380a8553df9be2a20e2c7e5bf93ea97f29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 35\\%\\qquad\\text{(B)}\\ 44\\%\\qquad\\text{(C)}\\ 50\\%\\qquad\\text{(D)}\\ 56\\%\\qquad\\text{(E)}\\ 60\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"451\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let's assume that each item is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> dollars. First we take off <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/e/32e5939a7bdd847ec86582225cd653c240b4abce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> off of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> dollars. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/6/366319e60aa4aad8849160c80ceb04c4902f3d60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\cdot0.7=70$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"105\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Next, we take off the extra <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> as asked by the problem. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/0/e30a3e47399193fbcf400481e801944acb67a98c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70\\cdot0.80=56$\" width=\"105\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>So the final price of an item is \\$56. We have to do <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/2/a22838a21160190d031aa75d722e7d44a9d58bcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100-56$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"70\" height=\"15\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/9/6392be3c4d257afbc7ed9283bdb8ba630f4ef7e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$56$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> was the final price and we wanted the discount. So the final answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/0/6f096a4561dbd8f609e2d3e42e8efaf581ab1e26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$44\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, which is answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/0/4905fbc5c5564b6be82d30b9cc3d60c2fc3930f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(B) 44 \\%}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"75\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the price of an item on sale. When the item is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/e/32e5939a7bdd847ec86582225cd653c240b4abce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> off, its new price is \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/a/66ac4cd72ddaa55ad34fc8a30f6a92ef15dc940e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(1-0.3)x=0.7x.\\]\" width=\"139\" height=\"18\" />\nWhen <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> is taken off of that price, the item's final sales price is \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/1/2a15423f1cf8bd5092e63fc38e7615d71fb0462d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(1-0.2)\\cdot0.7x=0.8\\cdot0.7x=0.56x=(1-0.44)x.\\]\" width=\"390\" height=\"18\" />\nTherefore, the item was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/0/6f096a4561dbd8f609e2d3e42e8efaf581ab1e26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$44\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> off, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/5/7a558b37c441e1b7ac7c5ff6a848f199ac53ba75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"40\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/DUqszaQ01lM\">https://youtu.be/DUqszaQ01lM</a> Soo, DRMS, NM\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UR2aLmJHoIs\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UR2aLmJHoIs</a>  ~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zLXShtJzFM4\">https://youtu.be/zLXShtJzFM4</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 8\">2002 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2002\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 